! Settings

!! Stub threshold

A note whose body length is below this threshold is shown in the ''Write → Stubs'' column.

Current value: <$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/rimir/knowledge-app/stub-threshold" default="200" tag="input" size="6"/> characters

!! Capture inbox prefix

New notes from the topbar's quick-capture get this prefix unless the typed title already starts with `knowledge/`.

Current value: <$edit-text tiddler="$:/config/rimir/knowledge-app/capture-prefix" default="knowledge/inbox/" tag="input" size="30"/>

!! Namespace feature flags

The app enables these on install. Toggle them via the [[namespace plugin|$:/plugins/rimir/namespace]] settings tab if needed.

* `$:/config/rimir/namespace/walk-up` — short refs walk up the source tiddler's path
* `$:/config/rimir/namespace/aliases` — exact + pattern aliases for short refs
* `$:/config/rimir/namespace/pseudo-expansion` — pluggable pseudo segments (`_latest`, `_index`)

